+## GLM EXL3 prompt kernel (TF_GLM_EXL3_PROMPT)
+
+`cuda/exl3/experts_prompt.cu` (`mcg2`, `decode_tile_p`, `mma16816`, `fwht128`, `bf16r`, the cp.async and ldmatrix
+helpers, `PromptCfg`, `prompt_tile`, `prompt_mainloop`, `prompt_spill`, `prompt_smem`, `prompt_order_kernel`,
+`prompt_gateup_kernel`, `prompt_down_kernel`, `prompt_launch`), the `prompt` binding in `cuda/exl3/experts.cpp`, and
+`routed(.., prompt, prompt_pass)` / `prompt_kernel_ready` / `prompt_items` in `cuda/exl3/experts.py` are ported from
+MiaAI-Lab's
+[GLM-5.3-Flash EXL3 2x DGX Spark recipe](https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-2x-DGX-Sparks-TensorFold/tree/1576746)
+patch 0004-glm-prompt-kernels (its EXL3 prompt kernels, at the end state of the recipe's chain: with
+0009-glm-prefill-kernels' shared-row inputs and 0020-glm-prompt-experts-order's item order), Apache License 2.0,
+Copyright 2026 MiaAI-Lab (see [the license text](LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt)). The helpers, the main loop, the spill, the
+item order and the two kernels' arithmetic are the recipe's code. Changes in the port, data movement only: the kernels
+read each expert's trellis through the universal layer's pointer table (the recipe stacks a layer's trellises) and
+run the recipe's main loop on it; a member is the universal grouping's code `row * 32 + slot`, read as the recipe
+plan's pair `row * slots + slot`; `prompt_plan_kernel` (new) lays the universal grouping out as the recipe plan's items
+(expert, first member, count) of up to a pass's members. `families/glm5_next/cuda/exl3_generic.py`'s
+`prompt_switches` reads the recipe's names (`TF_GLM_EXL3_PROMPT`, `TF_GLM_EXL3_PASS`, `TF_GLM_EXL3_ORDER`,
+`TF_GLM_EXL3_ROWROT`), and the AFD expert node (`experts_node.py`) takes the kernel for prompt chunks only, as the
+recipe's prompt-chunk buffers do. A prompt row's expert outputs are then the recipe's prompt bits, not the grouped
+kernel's. `TF_GLM_EXL3_PROMPT` is off unless set (the recipe's code turns it on).
diff --git a/src/tensorfold/cuda/exl3/experts.cpp b/src/tensorfold/cuda/exl3/experts.cpp
index 5198fb7..87f8968 100644
--- a/src/tensorfold/cuda/exl3/experts.cpp
+++ b/src/tensorfold/cuda/exl3/experts.cpp
@@ -22,6 +22,11 @@ void exl3x_down_epilogue_cuda(const at::Tensor&, const at::Tensor&, const at::Te
